[00:39.21] Christabel strips
[00:40.43] And slips like a dream
[00:42.34] Breaking ice with arms that gleam with pain
[00:46.36] Disdain...
[00:47.19] She throws her head
[00:48.98] And glides against the stream
[00:52.20] Throwing me her bravest smile
[00:55.09] Defiant
[00:55.96] Glittering
[00:56.94] Shivering guile
[00:58.69] Catching a cold is quick this time
[01:01.79] But fish? ... fish may take a while...
[01:31.23] Christabel dips and slips from me
[01:33.60] And hand pushed deep inside is suddenly free
[01:38.06] Triumphant
[01:39.09] Reluctantly
[01:39.97] Struggling six legs held up for me to see
[01:44.19] Don't be scared
[01:45.34] It's nothing new
[01:46.70] It's the same old game; only fun with two...
[01:50.31] But fast and over and over
[01:53.49] I can't play this game with you
[01:57.11] Everything she tries to tell me
[02:00.32] Leaves me open mouthed and still
[02:03.40] Foolishly arrange tomorrow
[02:07.13] The way I always will
[02:48.95] Christabel trips
[02:50.10] And grips my hand
[02:51.72] But never to be saved
[02:54.52] For a second I understand
[02:56.55] And I fall with her...
[03:01.72] I'll never leave you
[03:03.36] Love you
[03:04.20] See you change into the man I want
[03:08.29] But it's not for long this thing
[03:12.15] It's not for long...
[03:42.08] 